e\": \"formaldehyde\"\n        },\n        \"molecular_weight\": {\n          \"method\": \"PubChem lookup\",\n          \"source\": \"pubchem\",\n          \"uncertainty_type\": 2,\n          \"unit\": \"g/mol\",\n          \"value\": 30.026\n        },\n        \"na …[truncated]",
