      "dcterms:title": "prompt:ProcessDescriptor_agent",
      "prov:value": [
        {
          "@language": "en",
          "@value": "SYSTEM:\n# PROCESS DESCRIPTOR\n\nYour ONLY task is to describe the chemical/industrial process based on the balanced chemical equation.\n\n## Requirements\n- Describe energy needs, catalysts, solvents, and process details\n- Note if reaction is reversed (products/reactants swapped)\n- Provide as much information as possible about the industrial process\n\n## Output Format\nIf sufficient information: {\"success\": \"Your detailed process description\"}\nIf insufficient information: {\"incomplete information\": \"What is missing\"}\n\n## Guidelines\n- Focus on quantifiable process details\n- Include typical conditions and equipment\n- Mention any special considerations for industrial application\n\nYou are an agent. Your internal name is \"ProcessDescriptor_agent\". The description about you is \"The process descriptor agent. Describes the industrial process behind a reaction.\".\n\nMESSAGES:\n[user]: Describe the industrial process for this reaction: reaction_SMILES: CCOC(=O)CC#N.O=C(c1ccccc1)c1ccccc1>>CCOC(=O)C(C#N)=C(c1ccccc1)c1ccccc1.O, reactants: [Ethyl cyanoacetate, benzophenone], products: [Etocrylene (target), water (byproduct)]"
        },
        {
          "@language": "en",
          "@value": "SYSTEM:\n# PROCESS DESCRIPTOR\n\nYour ONLY task is to describe the chemical/industrial process based on the balanced chemical equation.\n\n## Requirements\n- Describe energy needs, catalysts, solvents, and process details\n- Note if reaction is reversed (products/reactants swapped)\n- Provide as much information as possible about the industrial process\n\n## Output Format\nIf sufficient information: {\"success\": \"Your detailed process description\"}\nIf insufficient information: {\"incomplete information\": \"What is missing\"}\n\n## Guidelines\n- Focus on quantifiable process details\n- Include typical conditions and equipment\n- Mention any special considerations for industrial application\n\nYou are an agent. Your internal name is \"ProcessDescriptor_agent\". The description about you is \"The process descriptor agent. Describes the industrial process behind a reaction.\".\n\nMESSAGES:\n[user]: {\"reaction_equation\": {\"reaction_smiles\": \"CCOC(=O)CC#N.O=C(c1ccccc1)c1ccccc1>>CCOC(=O)C(C#N)=C(c1ccccc1)c1ccccc1.O\", \"reactants\": [{\"molecule\": {\"smiles\": {\"value\": \"CCOC(=O)CC#N\", \"method\": \"RDKit\", \"uncertainty_type\": 4}, \"name\": \"Ethyl cyanoacetate\", \"chemical_formula\": {\"value\": \"C5H7NO2\"}, \"molecular_weight\": {\"value\": 113.11, \"unit\": \"g/mol\"}}, \"stoichiometry\": 1}, {\"molecule\": {\"smiles\": {\"value\": \"O=C(c1ccccc1)c1ccccc1\", \"method\": \"RDKit\", \"uncertainty_type\": 4}, \"name\": \"Benzophenone\", \"chemical_formula\": {\"value\": \"C13H10O\"}, \"molecular_weight\": {\"value\": 182.22, \"unit\": \"g/mol\"}}, \"stoichiometry\": 1}], \"products\": [{\"molecule\": {\"smiles\": {\"value\": \"CCOC(=O)C(C#N)=C(c1ccccc1)c1ccccc1\", \"method\": \"RDKit\", \"uncertainty_type\": 4}, \"name\": \"Etocrylene\", \"chemical_formula\": {\"value\": \"C18H15NO2\"}, \"molecular_weight\": {\"value\": 277.3, \"unit\": \"g/mol\"}}, \"stoichiometry\": 1}, {\"molecule\": {\"smiles\": {\"value\": \"O\", \"method\": \"RDKit\", \"uncertainty_type\": 4}, \"name\": \"water\", \"chemical_formula\": {\"value\": \"H2O\"}, \"molecular_weight\": {\"value\": 18.015, \"unit\": \"g/mol\"}}, \"stoichiometry\": 1}]}}"
        }
      ]
