      "prov:value": "Perfect! The reaction is balanced. Now let me compile the final output:\n\n## ✅ Reaction Completed\n\nThis is an **esterification reaction** converting **Etocrylene** (ethyl 2-cyano-3,3-diphenylprop-2-enoate) to **Octocrylene** (2-ethylhexyl ester) using 2-ethylhexanol as the alcohol nucleophile.\n\n**Byproduct identified:** Ethanol (CCO) – the displaced ethoxy group from the original ester\n\nHere is the completed reaction-step object:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"reaction_SMILES\": \"CCOC(=O)C(C#N)=C(c1ccccc1)c1ccccc1.CCCCC(CC)CO>>CCCCC(CC)COC(=O)C(C#N)=C(c1ccccc1)c1ccccc1.CCO\",\n  \"target_molecule\": {\n    \"smiles\": {\n      \"value\": \"CCCCC(CC)COC(=O)C(C#N)=C(c1ccccc1)c1ccccc1\",\n      \"method\": \"RDKit\",\n      \"source\": \"EquationBalancer_agent\",\n      \"uncertainty_type\": 4\n    },\n    \"name\": \"Octocrylene\",\n    \"chemical_formula\": {\n      \"value\": \"C24H27NO2\",\n      \"method\": \"PubChem lookup\",\n      \"source\": \"pubchem\",\n      \"uncertainty_type\": 2\n    },\n    \"molecular_weight\": {\n      \"value\": 361.5,\n      \"unit\": \"g/mol\",\n      \"method\": \"PubChem lookup\",\n      \"source\": \"pubchem\",\n      \"uncertainty_type\": 2\n    },\n    \"inchi\": {\n      \"value\": \"InChI=1S/C24H27NO2/c1-3-5-12-19(4-2)18-27-24(26)22(17-25)23(20-13-8-6-9-14-20)21-15-10-7-11-16-21/h6-11,13-16,19H,3-5,12,18H2,1-2H3\",\n      \"method\": \"PubChem lookup\",\n      \"source\": \"pubchem\",\n      \"uncertainty_type\": 2\n    },\n    \"iupac_name\": {\n      \"value\": \"2-ethylhexyl 2-cyano-3,3-diphenylprop-2-enoate\",\n      \"method\": \"PubChem lookup\",\n      \"source\": \"pubchem\",\n      \"uncertainty_type\": 2\n    },\n    \"source\": \"EquationBalancer_agent\",\n    \"uncertainty_type\": 4\n  },\n  \"byproducts\": [\n    {\n      \"smiles\": {\n        \"value\": \"CCO\",\n        \"method\": \"RDKit\",\n        \"source\": \"EquationBalancer_agent\",\n        \"uncertainty_type\": 4\n      },\n      \"name\": \"ethanol\",\n      \"chemical_formula\": {\n        \"value\": \"C2H6O\",\n        \"method\": \"PubChem lookup\",\n        \"source\": \"pubchem\",\n        \"uncertainty_type\": 2\n      },\n      \"molecular_we …[truncated]",
