      "prov:value": "Now I'll construct the complete ReactionNode object:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"reaction_SMILES\": \"CCOC(=O)CC#N.O=C(c1ccccc1)c1ccccc1>>CCOC(=O)C(C#N)=C(c1ccccc1)c1ccccc1.O\",\n  \"source\": \"SynthesisCompleter_agent\",\n  \"uncertainty_type\": 4,\n  \"target_molecule\": {\n    \"smiles\": {\n      \"value\": \"CCOC(=O)C(C#N)=C(c1ccccc1)c1ccccc1\",\n      \"method\": \"RDKit\",\n      \"source\": \"pubchem\",\n      \"uncertainty_type\": 2\n    },\n    \"name\": \"Etocrylene\",\n    \"chemical_formula\": {\n      \"value\": \"C18H15NO2\",\n      \"method\": \"PubChem lookup\",\n      \"source\": \"pubchem\",\n      \"uncertainty_type\": 2\n    },\n    \"molecular_weight\": {\n      \"value\": 277.3,\n      \"unit\": \"g/mol\",\n      \"method\": \"PubChem lookup\",\n      \"source\": \"pubchem\",\n      \"uncertainty_type\": 2\n    },\n    \"inchi\": {\n      \"value\": \"InChI=1S/C18H15NO2/c1-2-21-18(20)16(13-19)17(14-9-5-3-6-10-14)15-11-7-4-8-12-15/h3-12H,2H2,1H3\",\n      \"method\": \"PubChem lookup\",\n      \"source\": \"pubchem\",\n      \"uncertainty_type\": 2\n    },\n    \"iupac_name\": {\n      \"value\": \"ethyl 2-cyano-3,3-diphenylprop-2-enoate\",\n      \"method\": \"PubChem lookup\",\n      \"source\": \"pubchem\",\n      \"uncertainty_type\": 2\n    },\n    \"source\": \"pubchem\",\n    \"uncertainty_type\": 2,\n    \"physical_properties\": []\n  },\n  \"byproducts\": [\n    {\n      \"smiles\": {\n        \"value\": \"O\",\n        \"method\": \"RDKit\",\n        \"source\": \"SynthesisCompleter_agent\",\n        \"uncertainty_type\": 4\n      },\n      \"name\": \"water\",\n      \"chemical_formula\": {\n        \"value\": \"H2O\",\n        \"method\": \"byproduct suggestion\",\n        \"source\": \"SynthesisCompleter_agent\",\n        \"uncertainty_type\": 3\n      },\n      \"molecular_weight\": {\n        \"value\": 18.015,\n        \"unit\": \"g/mol\",\n        \"method\": \"standard molecular weight\",\n        \"source\": \"SynthesisCompleter_agent\",\n        \"uncertainty_type\": 2\n      },\n      \"inchi\": {\n        \"value\": \"InChI=1S/H2O/h1H2\",\n        \"method\": \"standard InChI\",\n        \"source\": \"SynthesisCompleter_agent\",\n        \"uncertainty_type\": 2\n      },\n    …[truncated]",
